CHAPTER.VERS:
And the sons of Tola; Uzzi, and Rephaiah, and Jeriel, and Jahmai, and Jibsam, and Shemuel, heads of their father's house, [to wit], of Tola: [they were] valiant men of might in their generations; 

          That is, their number was found to be this big when David counted the people, (2Sa_24:1).
         whose number [was] in the days of David two and twenty thousand and six hundred.
